<title>GERMANY: Beiersdorf 1996 net profit rises 2.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Beiersdorf 1996 net profit rises 2.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German cosmetics and medication maker Beiersdorf AG said on Tuesday 1996 net profit rose 2.9 percent to 233.8 million marks ($137.3 million) as sales increased 8.2 percent to 5.78 billion marks ($3.4 billion).</p>
<p>The company aslo said it expected an improvement in operating reults in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150 ($ = 1.702 German Marks)</p>
</text>
